## 🗂️ Dataset

Auto-generated using `NumPy` with `seed=42` for reproducibility. No external download needed.

| Column | Description |
|---|---|
| `user_id` | Unique ID (1–5200) |
| `group` | Control or Treatment (50/50 split) |
| `acquisition_week` | Week user joined (Week 1–6) |
| `visited` | Always 1 — all users visited |
| `add_to_cart` | 1 if added to cart, else 0 |
| `checkout` | 1 if reached checkout, else 0 |
| `purchased` | 1 if completed purchase, else 0 |

**Simulation probabilities:**

| Stage | Control | Treatment |
|---|---|---|
| Add to Cart | 60% | 65% |
| Checkout (if cart) | 50% | 50% |
| Purchase (if checkout) | 55% | 62% |

