## 📊 Results

| Metric | Value |
|---|---|
| Control Conversion Rate | 16.17% |
| Treatment Conversion Rate | 19.90% |
| **Lift** | **+23.1%** |
| Z-Statistic | 3.5002 |
| P-Value | 0.0005 |
| **Decision** | ✅ Reject H₀ — Statistically Significant |

### Funnel
| Stage | Control | Treatment |
|---|---|---|
| Visited | 100.0% | 100.0% |
| Add to Cart | 58.6% | 63.7% |
| Checkout | 29.8% | 31.8% |
| **Purchased** | **16.2%** | **19.9%** |

**Biggest drop-off:** Visited → Add to Cart **(−41.4%)**

### Cohorts
| Week | Users | Converted | Rate |
|---|---|---|---|
| Week 1 | 1,071 | 204 | 19.0% |
| Week 2 | 928 | 159 | 17.1% |
| Week 3 | 861 | 162 | 18.8% |
| Week 4 | 906 | 157 | 17.3% |
| Week 5 | 770 | 135 | 17.5% |
| Week 6 | 664 | 118 | 17.8% |

