## 💡 Key Insights

1. **Deploy the new UI** — +23.1% lift is statistically proven (p = 0.0005)
2. **Fix Add-to-Cart drop** — 40% leave before adding; improve product CTAs
3. **Re-engage later cohorts** — Week 4–6 users convert slightly less
4. **Monitor post-launch** — Track cohorts after full rollout
5. **Next experiment** — A/B test the product listing page

